    "detailed_description": "Here's the English translation of the Japanese text you provided:<br>I am a rubber-headed human<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139730/extras/_5.png?t=1724338833\" /></span><br>I absolutely want to climb<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139730/extras/_4.png?t=1724338833\" /></span><br>Someday, I'll definitely climb it<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139730/extras/_3.png?t=1724338833\" /></span><br>Uoooooo<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139730/extras/_2.png?t=1724338833\" /></span><br>Orryaaaaaaaa<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139730/extras/c6b7ba383e2d7560242dfab815982c68.avif?t=1724338833\" width=500 height=200 /></span><br>I'm ready.<br>How about you?<br><br><br><br>---------------------------------<br>This game is a climbing game where a rubber-headed human jumps to reach the goal at the top.<br>Enjoy the animals and various objects you encounter along the way as you aim for the goal.<br><br>---------------------------------<br>[Controls]<br>Left: A<br>Right: D<br>Pause: ESC<br>Jump: Space",
